<span class="syn-cmd">export</span> <span class="syn-v">AGPOOL_KEY</span>=0x<span class="syn-pun">&lt;</span>agent-wallet-private-key<span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span>   <span class="syn-c"># a dedicated wallet, never your main one</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">export</span> <span class="syn-v">AGPOOL_JSON</span>=<span class="syn-n">1</span>                 <span class="syn-c"># every command prints one JSON object on stdout</span>

<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">address</span>                       <span class="syn-c"># → {"ok":true,"command":"address","address":"0x…"}  fund this address</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">deposit</span> <span class="syn-n">25</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base          <span class="syn-c"># shield 25 USDC (the only step that needs gas)</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">send</span> 0xRECIPIENT <span class="syn-n">10</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-c"># private payment, relayer pays gas</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">balance</span> <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc             <span class="syn-c"># → {"ok":true,…,"balance":"13.965",…}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Agent app with MCP support? Skip the shell entirely: see §9.</p>
<p>Paste this into your agent's instructions:</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="text"><code>You can make private crypto payments with the `agpool` CLI (env AGPOOL_KEY and AGPOOL_JSON=1 are set).
Always run commands with a timeout of at least 300 seconds and parse the single JSON object on stdout.
"ok": true means it succeeded; "ok": false has an "error" to report. Exit code 2 means you called it wrong.
Before paying, check `agpool balance --chain &lt;c&gt; --pool &lt;p&gt;`; if it is short, `agpool deposit` first.
Never retry deposit, send, swap or bridge after a timeout or unclear failure: run `agpool balance --wait`
(or `agpool bridges`) to see whether it landed. `agpool recover --chain all` is always safe to run.
Never print, log or share AGPOOL_KEY or anything in ~/.agpool.
Full guide: https://agpool.cash/AGENTS.md</code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<hr>
<h2 id="2-how-agpool-works-what-an-agent-needs-to-know"><a href="#2-how-agpool-works-what-an-agent-needs-to-know">2. How Agpool works (what an agent needs to know)</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Public balance</strong>: tokens in the agent wallet, visible to everyone.</li>
<li><strong>Private balance</strong>: notes inside an Agpool pool contract. Spending them reveals neither the agent wallet nor which deposit paid.</li>
<li><strong>Shield (<code>deposit</code>)</strong>: moves public funds into the pool. Signed and paid (gas) by the agent wallet. This is the only on-chain action that shows your wallet.</li>
<li><strong>Private operations (<code>send</code>, <code>swap</code>, <code>bridge</code>)</strong>: a zero-knowledge proof spends notes; the Agpool relayer submits the transaction and pays gas. The fee is taken from the amount moved, so the agent needs no gas for these.</li>
<li><strong>Burner</strong>: a one-time wallet used inside <code>swap</code> and <code>bridge</code>. Its key is encrypted locally and registered before it is funded, so <code>recover</code> can always sweep it.</li>
<li><strong>Account</strong>: derived from one signature of the Agpool sign-in message by the agent wallet. Same key → same private account on every chain and machine.</li>
<li><strong>Pools are per chain and per asset.</strong> A private USDC balance on Base cannot pay on Arbitrum; use <code>bridge</code> to move between chains.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="3-setup"><a href="#3-setup">3. Setup</a></h2>
<h3 id="3-1-install"><a href="#3-1-install">3.1 Install</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">npm</span> i <span class="syn-f">-g</span> @agpool/cli        <span class="syn-c"># global: `agpool …`</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">npx</span> <span class="syn-f">-y</span> @agpool/cli@latest …  <span class="syn-c"># no install, always the newest version</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">version</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span>        <span class="syn-c"># {"ok":true,"command":"version","version":"0.2.0"}</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">latest</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span>         <span class="syn-c"># {"ok":true,"command":"latest","installed":"0.2.0","latest":"0.2.0","upToDate":true}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="3-2-configure"><a href="#3-2-configure">3.2 Configure</a></h3>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Variable</th><th>Required</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_KEY</code></td><td>yes (or run <code>agpool login</code> once)</td><td>Agent wallet private key, 0x-prefixed hex. Used only locally.</td></tr><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_JSON</code></td><td>recommended</td><td><code>1</code> = JSON output for every command (same as adding <code>--json</code>).</td></tr><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_HOME</code></td><td>no</td><td>Config/cache directory, default <code>~/.agpool</code>. Set it when the home directory is read-only (containers, serverless).</td></tr><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_API</code></td><td>no</td><td>API base URL, default <code>https://api.agpool.cash</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Without <code>AGPOOL_KEY</code>, <code>agpool login</code> asks for the key with a hidden prompt and stores it at <code>~/.agpool/wallet.json</code> (mode 600). Agents should prefer the environment variable.</p>
<h3 id="3-3-fund"><a href="#3-3-fund">3.3 Fund</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">address</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Send the agent wallet the asset you want to shield <strong>plus a little native gas for the deposit</strong> (a deposit uses about 1.3M gas; keep at least 0.0005 ETH on Robinhood Chain, Base or Arbitrum, or 0.002 BNB on BNB Chain). After shielding, private operations need no gas.</p>
<h3 id="3-4-verify"><a href="#3-4-verify">3.4 Verify</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">balance</span> <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> all <span class="syn-f">--json</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<hr>
<h2 id="4-command-reference"><a href="#4-command-reference">4. Command reference</a></h2>
<p>Every command accepts <code>--json</code>. Amounts are plain decimals in token units (<code>10</code>, <code>0.25</code>), never wei. <code>--chain</code> defaults to <code>base</code>. Typical durations assume a healthy network.</p>
<h3 id="address"><a href="#address"><code>address</code></a></h3>
<p>Print the agent wallet address.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"address"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"address"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x70997970C51812dc3A010C7d01b50e0d17dc79C8"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="balance-chain-c-all-pool-p-wait"><a href="#balance-chain-c-all-pool-p-wait"><code>balance [--chain C|all] [--pool P] [--wait]</code></a></h3>
<p>Private and public balances. <code>--pool</code> limits the answer to one private pool. <code>--wait</code> polls up to 30 s while a private balance reads 0 (use right after a deposit). ~5–15 s.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"pool"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"address"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"13.965"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"symbol"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"utxos"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">2</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Without <code>--pool</code> (one entry per chain; <code>--chain all</code> returns four):</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"balances"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"address"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"private"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ETH"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0.0"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"utxos"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">0</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"13.965"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"utxos"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">2</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"public"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ETH"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0.00412"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0.0"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>A value of <code>"?"</code> with an <code>error</code> field means that read failed; retry.</p>
<h3 id="deposit-lt-amount-gt-pool-p-chain-c"><a href="#deposit-lt-amount-gt-pool-p-chain-c"><code>deposit &lt;amount&gt; [--pool P] [--chain C]</code></a></h3>
<p>Shield public funds from the agent wallet. ERC-20 pools approve first (one extra transaction). Needs native gas. ~10–30 s (the first run also downloads the 20 MB proving key).</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"deposit"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"pool"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">25</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"symbol"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"txHash"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"explorer"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"https://basescan.org/tx/0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"privateBalance"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"25.0"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p><code>--pool</code> defaults to the chain's stablecoin pool.</p>
<h3 id="send-lt-recipient-gt-lt-amount-gt-pool-p-chain-c"><a href="#send-lt-recipient-gt-lt-amount-gt-pool-p-chain-c"><code>send &lt;recipient&gt; &lt;amount&gt; [--pool P] [--chain C]</code></a></h3>
<p>Private payment to any EVM address on the same chain. <code>amount</code> is what leaves your private balance; the recipient gets <code>amount − fee</code>. No gas needed. ~10–30 s.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"send"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"pool"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"recipient"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">10</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"received"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"8.965"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"fee"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"1.035"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"symbol"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"txHash"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"explorer"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"https://basescan.org/tx/0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>To make the recipient receive exactly <code>X</code>, send <code>(X + flat) / (1 − 0.0035)</code> rounded up (see §5).</p>
<p><code>amount</code> can be <code>max</code>: the whole private balance of <code>--pool</code>, of every pool on the chain when <code>--pool</code> is omitted, or of every pool on every chain with <code>--chain all</code>. A send spends at most two notes, so a balance spread over more notes goes out in several sends; a balance at or below twice its fee is left as dust.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"send"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"recipient"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"max"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"sends"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"bsc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"pool"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"usdt"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"12.253307487806713664"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"received"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"11.7104…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"fee"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0.5428…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"txHash"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"received"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"USDT"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"11.7104…"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"dust"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"errors"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="swap-lt-amount-gt-from-p-chain-c-slippage-bps"><a href="#swap-lt-amount-gt-from-p-chain-c-slippage-bps"><code>swap &lt;amount&gt; --from P [--chain C] [--slippage BPS]</code></a></h3>
<p>Private same-chain swap between the chain's native pool and stablecoin pool; the output is re-shielded into your private balance. <code>--slippage</code> in basis points, default <code>100</code> (1%). No gas needed. ~1–3 min.
<code>amount</code> can be <code>max</code>: the most one swap can move (its two largest notes). If the balance is spread over more notes, the output says what is left; run <code>swap max</code> again for the rest.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"swap"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"from"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"eth"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">0.01</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"received"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"22.41"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"symbol"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"txHash"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"explorer"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"https://basescan.org/tx/0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"privateBalance"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"36.375"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>If it fails half-way, funds sit on a registered burner: run <code>recover</code>.</p>
<h3 id="bridge-lt-dest-asset-gt-lt-recipient-gt-lt-amount-gt-from-origin-no-wait"><a href="#bridge-lt-dest-asset-gt-lt-recipient-gt-lt-amount-gt-from-origin-no-wait"><code>bridge &lt;dest-asset&gt; &lt;recipient&gt; &lt;amount&gt; --from ORIGIN [--no-wait]</code></a></h3>
<p>Private cross-chain transfer through NEAR Intents. <code>ORIGIN</code> is the private pool paying (default <code>base_usdc</code>); <code>dest-asset</code> and recipient format are listed in §6. The withdrawal is private; the solver delivers on the destination chain. Without <code>--no-wait</code> the CLI polls up to 6 minutes.
<code>amount</code> can be <code>max</code>: the most one bridge can move from the <code>--from</code> pool (its two largest notes); the route minimum still applies.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"bridge"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"from"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"to"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"sol_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"recipient"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"7Gx4…kQ2m"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amount"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">10</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"amountOutQuote"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"8.91"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"withdrawTx"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"depositAddress"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"statusUrl"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"https://…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"status"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"SUCCESS"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amountOut"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"8.93"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p><code>status</code> is <code>SUBMITTED</code> (with <code>--no-wait</code>), <code>SUCCESS</code>, or <code>PENDING</code> (still running after 6 min; check <code>bridges</code> later). A refund or failure returns <code>"ok":false</code>; refunds go to the agent wallet on the origin chain.</p>
<h3 id="bridges"><a href="#bridges"><code>bridges</code></a></h3>
<p>Every bridge this account has made, newest first, from the server-side intent registry (works from any machine).</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"bridges"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"bridges"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"status"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"SUCCESS"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"createdAt"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">1793760000000</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amountIn"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"10"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"fromAsset"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"toAsset"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"sol_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"recipient"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"7Gx4…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"refundTo"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"originChain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"amountOutQuote"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"8.91"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"amountOut"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"8.93"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"destTx"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"depositAddress"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"statusUrl"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"https://…"</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="assets"><a href="#assets"><code>assets</code></a></h3>
<p>Bridge destinations and valid origins, live from the API.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"assets"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"assets"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"sol_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"sol"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"symbol"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"USDC"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"decimals"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">6</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"isNative"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">false</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"…"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
 <span class="syn-key">"origins"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"base_eth"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"base_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"hood_eth"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"hood_usdg"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"arb_eth"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"arb_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"bsc_bnb"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"bsc_usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-s">"bsc_usdt"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="recover-to-addr-chain-c-all"><a href="#recover-to-addr-chain-c-all"><code>recover [--to ADDR] [--chain C|all]</code></a></h3>
<p>Sweep every registered burner that still holds funds to the agent wallet (or <code>--to</code>). Idempotent and safe at any time. Swept funds land in the <strong>public</strong> wallet; <code>deposit</code> again to make them private. ~10–60 s per chain. A burner that holds tokens but no gas gets a gas top-up from the relayer first; if that is refused, the result reports it in <code>needsGas</code> instead of claiming the chain is clean.</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">true</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"recover"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"recovered"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-key">"chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"to"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-s">"0x…"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"swept"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">1</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"dust"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">0</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"errors"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">0</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span><span class="syn-key">"needsGas"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span><span class="syn-n">0</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="login-logout-version-latest-help"><a href="#login-logout-version-latest-help"><code>login</code>, <code>logout</code>, <code>version</code>, <code>latest</code>, <code>help</code></a></h3>
<p><code>login</code> signs and caches the sign-in message (<code>{"address"}</code>); <code>logout</code> deletes the stored key and cache (<code>{"removed":[…]}</code>); <code>version</code> and <code>latest</code> report versions.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="5-chains-pools-fees-and-minimums"><a href="#5-chains-pools-fees-and-minimums">5. Chains, pools, fees and minimums</a></h2>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th><code>--chain</code></th><th>Pools (<code>--pool</code>)</th><th>Min deposit</th><th>Min send / swap / bridge</th><th>Flat fee</th><th>DEX for <code>swap</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>base</code> (default)</td><td><code>eth</code>, <code>usdc</code></td><td>0.001 ETH · 3 USDC</td><td>0.001 ETH · 2 USDC</td><td>0.00015 ETH · 1 USDC</td><td>Uniswap V3</td></tr><tr><td><code>robinhood</code></td><td><code>eth</code>, <code>usdg</code></td><td>0.001 ETH · 3 USDG</td><td>0.001 ETH · 2 USDG</td><td>0.00015 ETH · 0.5 USDG</td><td>Uniswap V3</td></tr><tr><td><code>arbitrum</code></td><td><code>eth</code>, <code>usdc</code></td><td>0.001 ETH · 3 USDC</td><td>0.001 ETH · 2 USDC</td><td>0.00015 ETH · 0.5 USDC</td><td>Uniswap V3</td></tr><tr><td><code>bsc</code></td><td><code>bnb</code>, <code>usdc</code>, <code>usdt</code></td><td>0.01 BNB · 3 USDC/USDT</td><td>0.001 BNB · 2 USDC/USDT</td><td>0.001 BNB · 0.5 USDC/USDT</td><td>PancakeSwap V3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul>
<li><strong>Fee</strong> on every private spend = flat fee + 0.35% of the amount, deducted from the amount. Example: <code>send 10</code> USDC on Base → fee 1 + 0.035 = 1.035, recipient gets 8.965.</li>
<li>A spend must be more than twice its own fee; the CLI enforces the minimums above before doing anything.</li>
<li>Bridges pay the pool fee plus the solver's quote (shown as <code>amountOutQuote</code>); each route also has a solver minimum.</li>
<li><code>deposit</code> costs only network gas; there is no Agpool fee on shielding.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="6-bridging"><a href="#6-bridging">6. Bridging</a></h2>
<p><strong>Origins</strong> (<code>--from</code>): <code>base_eth</code>, <code>base_usdc</code>, <code>hood_eth</code>, <code>hood_usdg</code> (Robinhood Chain), <code>arb_eth</code>, <code>arb_usdc</code>, <code>bsc_bnb</code>, <code>bsc_usdc</code>, <code>bsc_usdt</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Destinations</strong> (<code>dest-asset</code>; run <code>agpool assets</code> for the live list):</p>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Chain</th><th>Assets</th><th>Recipient format</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Base</td><td><code>base_eth</code>, <code>base_weth</code>, <code>base_usdc</code>, <code>base_cbbtc</code></td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code></td></tr><tr><td>Ethereum</td><td><code>eth_eth</code>, <code>eth_weth</code>, <code>eth_usdc</code>, <code>eth_usdt</code>, <code>eth_cbbtc</code></td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code></td></tr><tr><td>Arbitrum</td><td><code>arb_eth</code>, <code>arb_weth</code>, <code>arb_usdc</code>, <code>arb_usdt</code>, <code>arb_arb</code></td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code></td></tr><tr><td>BNB Chain</td><td><code>bsc_bnb</code>, <code>bsc_usdc</code>, <code>bsc_usdt</code></td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code></td></tr><tr><td>Robinhood Chain</td><td><code>hood_eth</code>, <code>hood_usdg</code>, <code>hood_weth</code>, <code>hood_usde</code></td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code></td></tr><tr><td>Solana</td><td><code>sol_sol</code>, <code>sol_usdc</code>, <code>sol_usdt</code></td><td>base58 public key</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Statuses</strong> in <code>bridges</code>: <code>PENDING_DEPOSIT</code> → <code>PROCESSING</code> → <code>SUCCESS</code>, or <code>REFUNDED</code> / <code>FAILED</code> (refund to <code>refundTo</code> on <code>originChain</code>). Treat any other value as in progress.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="7-recipes"><a href="#7-recipes">7. Recipes</a></h2>
<h3 id="pay-an-invoice-exactly"><a href="#pay-an-invoice-exactly">Pay an invoice exactly</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-c"># recipient must receive 50 USDC on Base: amount = (50 + 1) / 0.9965 = 51.18 (round up)</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">balance</span> <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--json</span>        <span class="syn-c"># need &gt;= 51.18</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">send</span> 0xVENDOR <span class="syn-n">51.18</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--json</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="top-up-only-when-needed"><a href="#top-up-only-when-needed">Top up only when needed</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">bal</span>=<span class="syn-pun">$(</span><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">balance</span> <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--json</span> <span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-cmd">jq</span> <span class="syn-f">-r</span> .<span class="syn-sub">balance</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">if</span> <span class="syn-pun">((</span> <span class="syn-pun">$(</span><span class="syn-cmd">echo</span> <span class="syn-s">"$bal &lt; 51.18"</span> <span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-cmd">bc</span> <span class="syn-f">-l</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">;</span> <span class="syn-cmd">then</span> agpool <span class="syn-sub">deposit</span> <span class="syn-n">100</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--json</span><span class="syn-pun">;</span> <span class="syn-cmd">fi</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="batch-payouts-sequential-never-parallel"><a href="#batch-payouts-sequential-never-parallel">Batch payouts (sequential, never parallel)</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">while</span> <span class="syn-v">IFS</span>=, read <span class="syn-f">-r</span> to amount<span class="syn-pun">;</span> <span class="syn-cmd">do</span>
  <span class="syn-cmd">out</span>=<span class="syn-pun">$(</span><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">send</span> <span class="syn-s">"$to"</span> <span class="syn-s">"$amount"</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--json</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
  <span class="syn-cmd">echo</span> <span class="syn-s">"$out"</span> <span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span><span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span> payouts.jsonl
  <span class="syn-pun">[</span> <span class="syn-s">"$(echo "</span>$out<span class="syn-s">" | jq -r .ok)"</span> = <span class="syn-s">"true"</span> <span class="syn-pun">]</span> || <span class="syn-pun">{</span> echo <span class="syn-s">"stopped at $to"</span>; break; <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">done</span> <span class="syn-pun">&lt;</span> payouts.csv</code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Run payouts one at a time: each spend consumes notes and returns change, so parallel sends from one account can race.</p>
<h3 id="swap-eth-to-usdc-privately"><a href="#swap-eth-to-usdc-privately">Swap ETH to USDC privately</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">swap</span> <span class="syn-n">0.01</span> <span class="syn-f">--from</span> eth <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> base <span class="syn-f">--json</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="bridge-to-solana-without-blocking"><a href="#bridge-to-solana-without-blocking">Bridge to Solana without blocking</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">bridge</span> sol_usdc <span class="syn-pun">&lt;</span>solana-address<span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span> <span class="syn-n">10</span> <span class="syn-f">--from</span> base_usdc <span class="syn-f">--no-wait</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">bridges</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span> <span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-cmd">jq</span> <span class="syn-s">'.bridges[0].status'</span>     <span class="syn-c"># poll every minute until SUCCESS / REFUNDED</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="move-private-funds-to-another-chain-rebalance"><a href="#move-private-funds-to-another-chain-rebalance">Move private funds to another chain (rebalance)</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">bridge</span> arb_usdc <span class="syn-pun">$(</span><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">address</span> <span class="syn-f">--json</span> <span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-cmd">jq</span> <span class="syn-f">-r</span> .<span class="syn-sub">address</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-n">20</span> <span class="syn-f">--from</span> base_usdc <span class="syn-f">--json</span>
<span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">deposit</span> <span class="syn-n">19</span> <span class="syn-f">--pool</span> usdc <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> arbitrum <span class="syn-f">--json</span>   <span class="syn-c"># re-shield on the destination chain</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>The bridge delivers to a public address; shield it again on the destination chain.</p>
<h3 id="health-check-before-a-run"><a href="#health-check-before-a-run">Health check before a run</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">curl</span> <span class="syn-f">-s</span> <span class="syn-u">https://api.agpool.cash/api/health</span> <span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-cmd">jq</span> <span class="syn-s">'.ok, .relayerGas'</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="clean-up-after-an-interrupted-swap-or-bridge"><a href="#clean-up-after-an-interrupted-swap-or-bridge">Clean up after an interrupted swap or bridge</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="shell"><code><span class="syn-cmd">agpool</span> <span class="syn-sub">recover</span> <span class="syn-f">--chain</span> all <span class="syn-f">--json</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<hr>
<h2 id="8-integration-code"><a href="#8-integration-code">8. Integration code</a></h2>
<h3 id="node-js"><a href="#node-js">Node.js</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="javascript"><code><span class="syn-k">import</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> execFile <span class="syn-pun">}</span> <span class="syn-k">from</span> <span class="syn-s">'node:child_process'</span>

<span class="syn-k">export</span> <span class="syn-k">function</span> <span class="syn-fn">agpool</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>args<span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> timeoutMs <span class="syn-pun">=</span> <span class="syn-n">300_000</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span> <span class="syn-pun">=</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
  <span class="syn-k">return</span> <span class="syn-k">new</span> <span class="syn-fn">Promise</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>resolve<span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">=</span><span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
    <span class="syn-fn">execFile</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-s">'agpool'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span>args<span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'--json'</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> timeout<span class="syn-pun">:</span> timeoutMs<span class="syn-pun">,</span> env<span class="syn-pun">:</span> process<span class="syn-pun">.</span>env <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-pun">(</span>err<span class="syn-pun">,</span> stdout<span class="syn-pun">,</span> stderr<span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">=</span><span class="syn-pun">&gt;</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
      <span class="syn-k">try</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> <span class="syn-fn">resolve</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-v">JSON</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">parse</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>stdout<span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">trim</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">split</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-s">'\n'</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">pop</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
      <span class="syn-k">catch</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> <span class="syn-fn">resolve</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">{</span> ok<span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-k">false</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> error<span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">(</span>stderr <span class="syn-pun">|</span><span class="syn-pun">|</span> err<span class="syn-pun">?</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span>message <span class="syn-pun">|</span><span class="syn-pun">|</span> <span class="syn-s">'no output'</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">trim</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> exitCode<span class="syn-pun">:</span> err<span class="syn-pun">?</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span>code <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
    <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
  <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
<span class="syn-pun">}</span>

<span class="syn-k">const</span> r <span class="syn-pun">=</span> <span class="syn-k">await</span> <span class="syn-fn">agpool</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">'send'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'0xRECIPIENT'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'10'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'--pool'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'usdc'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'--chain'</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">'base'</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
<span class="syn-k">if</span> <span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">!</span>r<span class="syn-pun">.</span>ok<span class="syn-pun">)</span> <span class="syn-k">throw</span> <span class="syn-k">new</span> <span class="syn-fn">Error</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>r<span class="syn-pun">.</span>error<span class="syn-pun">)</span>
console<span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">log</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>r<span class="syn-pun">.</span>txHash<span class="syn-pun">,</span> r<span class="syn-pun">.</span>received<span class="syn-pun">)</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="python"><a href="#python">Python</a></h3>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="python"><code><span class="syn-k">import</span> json<span class="syn-pun">,</span> subprocess

<span class="syn-k">def</span> <span class="syn-fn">agpool</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">*</span>args<span class="syn-pun">,</span> timeout<span class="syn-pun">=</span><span class="syn-n">300</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span>
    p <span class="syn-pun">=</span> subprocess<span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">run</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"agpool"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-pun">*</span>args<span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"--json"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> capture_output<span class="syn-pun">=</span><span class="syn-k">True</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> text<span class="syn-pun">=</span><span class="syn-k">True</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> timeout<span class="syn-pun">=</span>timeout<span class="syn-pun">)</span>
    <span class="syn-k">try</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span>
        <span class="syn-k">return</span> json<span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">loads</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>p<span class="syn-pun">.</span>stdout<span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">strip</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">splitlines</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-pun">-</span><span class="syn-n">1</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
    <span class="syn-k">except</span> <span class="syn-pun">(</span>ValueError<span class="syn-pun">,</span> IndexError<span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span>
        <span class="syn-k">return</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span><span class="syn-s">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-k">False</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"error"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">(</span>p<span class="syn-pun">.</span>stderr <span class="syn-k">or</span> <span class="syn-s">"no output"</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">.</span><span class="syn-fn">strip</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"exitCode"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> p<span class="syn-pun">.</span>returncode<span class="syn-pun">}</span>

r <span class="syn-pun">=</span> <span class="syn-fn">agpool</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span><span class="syn-s">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"--chain"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"base"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"--pool"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"usdc"</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span>
<span class="syn-fn">print</span><span class="syn-pun">(</span>r<span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"balance"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span> <span class="syn-k">if</span> r<span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"ok"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span> <span class="syn-k">else</span> r<span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"error"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">)</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<h3 id="tool-definition-for-function-calling-models"><a href="#tool-definition-for-function-calling-models">Tool definition for function-calling models</a></h3>
<p>Expose one tool and let the model choose the command:</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"name"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"agpool"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"description"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"Private crypto payments via the Agpool CLI. Commands: address; balance [--chain base|robinhood|arbitrum|bsc|all] [--pool P] [--wait]; deposit &lt;amount&gt; [--pool P] [--chain C]; send &lt;recipient&gt; &lt;amount&gt; [--pool P] [--chain C]; swap &lt;amount&gt; --from P [--chain C]; bridge &lt;dest-asset&gt; &lt;recipient&gt; &lt;amount&gt; --from ORIGIN [--no-wait]; bridges; assets; recover [--chain C|all]. Returns one JSON object; ok=false carries an error. Never retry deposit/send/swap/bridge without checking balance first."</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"input_schema"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
    <span class="syn-key">"type"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"object"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
    <span class="syn-key">"properties"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
      <span class="syn-key">"args"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> <span class="syn-key">"type"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"array"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-key">"items"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> <span class="syn-key">"type"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"string"</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-key">"description"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"CLI arguments, e.g. [\"send\",\"0xabc…\",\"10\",\"--pool\",\"usdc\",\"--chain\",\"base\"]"</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
    <span class="syn-pun">}</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
    <span class="syn-key">"required"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"args"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span>
  <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
<span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Implement it with the Node or Python wrapper above. Allow-list the first argument to the commands you want the agent to use (for example only <code>balance</code>, <code>send</code> and <code>bridges</code>).</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="9-mcp-servers"><a href="#9-mcp-servers">9. MCP servers</a></h2>
<p>Agpool speaks the <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Model Context Protocol</a>, so any MCP-capable agent app can call it as tools instead of running shell commands. There are two servers.</p>
<p>Both are listed publicly, so an agent app or directory can find them by name:</p>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Listing</th><th>Name</th><th>What is listed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io/v0.1/servers/cash.agpool%2Fagpool/versions/latest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official MCP Registry</a></td><td><code>cash.agpool/agpool</code></td><td>The local server (npm package) and the hosted endpoint</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/agpooldev/agpool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Glama — server</a></td><td><code>agpooldev/agpool</code></td><td>The local server, built and tested from the open-source repository</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://glama.ai/mcp/connectors/cash.agpool/agpool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Glama — connector</a></td><td><code>cash.agpool/agpool</code></td><td>The hosted endpoint, ownership verified and health-checked</td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@agpool/cli" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">npm</a></td><td><code>@agpool/cli</code></td><td>The package that runs the local server</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="9-1-local-server-payments-recommended"><a href="#9-1-local-server-payments-recommended">9.1 Local server — payments (recommended)</a></h3>
<p>Runs on your machine over stdio and exposes the full CLI as tools. The wallet key stays in the local environment; tools behave exactly like the commands in §4 and return the same JSON.</p>
<p>Add it to your app's MCP configuration (most apps use this <code>mcpServers</code> format):</p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"mcpServers"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
    <span class="syn-key">"agpool"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
      <span class="syn-key">"command"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"npx"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
      <span class="syn-key">"args"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">[</span><span class="syn-s">"-y"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"@agpool/cli@latest"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span> <span class="syn-s">"mcp"</span><span class="syn-pun">]</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
      <span class="syn-key">"env"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
        <span class="syn-key">"AGPOOL_KEY"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"0x&lt;agent-wallet-private-key&gt;"</span><span class="syn-pun">,</span>
        <span class="syn-key">"AGPOOL_MCP_TOOLS"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"balance,send,bridges"</span>
      <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
    <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
  <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
<span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>With the CLI installed globally, <code>"command": "agpool", "args": ["mcp"]</code> works too. Apps that add servers from a terminal take the same command: <code>npx -y @agpool/cli@latest mcp</code>.</p>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Does</th><th>Annotations</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>agpool_address</code></td><td>Agent wallet address</td><td>read-only</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_balance</code></td><td>Private and public balances (<code>chain</code>, <code>pool</code>, <code>wait</code>)</td><td>read-only</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_deposit</code></td><td>Shield from the agent wallet (<code>amount</code>, <code>pool</code>, <code>chain</code>)</td><td>destructive</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_send</code></td><td>Private payment (<code>recipient</code>, <code>amount</code>, <code>pool</code>, <code>chain</code>)</td><td>destructive</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_swap</code></td><td>Private same-chain swap (<code>amount</code>, <code>from</code>, <code>chain</code>, <code>slippage_bps</code>)</td><td>destructive</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_bridge</code></td><td>Private bridge (<code>dest_asset</code>, <code>recipient</code>, <code>amount</code>, <code>from</code>, <code>wait</code>)</td><td>destructive</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_bridges</code></td><td>Bridge history and status</td><td>read-only</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_assets</code></td><td>Bridge destinations and origins</td><td>read-only</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_recover</code></td><td>Sweep stranded burners (<code>chain</code>, <code>to</code>)</td><td>idempotent</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Resource: <code>agpool://agents.md</code> (this guide).</p>
<p>Limit what the agent can do from the configuration:</p>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Variable</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_MCP_TOOLS</code></td><td>Comma-separated allow-list, e.g. <code>balance,send,bridges</code> (with or without the <code>agpool_</code> prefix).</td></tr><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_MCP_READONLY</code></td><td><code>1</code> exposes only read-only tools.</td></tr><tr><td><code>AGPOOL_HOME</code>, <code>AGPOOL_API</code></td><td>Same as for the CLI (§3.2).</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Every tool result carries the command's JSON as <code>structuredContent</code> (and as text); <code>isError</code> is <code>true</code> when <code>"ok": false</code>. The retry rules in §12 apply unchanged: never repeat <code>agpool_deposit</code>, <code>agpool_send</code>, <code>agpool_swap</code> or <code>agpool_bridge</code> after a timeout without checking <code>agpool_balance</code> or <code>agpool_bridges</code> first.</p>
<h3 id="9-2-hosted-server-read-only"><a href="#9-2-hosted-server-read-only">9.2 Hosted server — read-only</a></h3>
<p><code>https://mcp.agpool.cash/mcp</code> (Streamable HTTP, no sign-in). It never receives keys or signatures, so it can only answer questions:</p>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Returns</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>agpool_status</code></td><td>API health, configured pools, relayer gas per chain</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_fees</code></td><td>Flat fee, rate, minimum deposit and minimum spend per pool</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_assets</code></td><td>Bridge destinations and origins</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_bridge_quote</code></td><td>Indicative quote (<code>from</code>, <code>to</code>, <code>amount</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_analytics</code></td><td>Shielded notes per chain and pool, relayer fees</td></tr><tr><td><code>agpool_guide</code></td><td>This guide, whole or one section (<code>section</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="json"><code><span class="syn-pun">{</span>
  <span class="syn-key">"mcpServers"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span>
    <span class="syn-key">"agpool-info"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-pun">{</span> <span class="syn-key">"url"</span><span class="syn-pun">:</span> <span class="syn-s">"https://mcp.agpool.cash/mcp"</span> <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
  <span class="syn-pun">}</span>
<span class="syn-pun">}</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>Use the hosted server to plan (fees, routes, quotes, status) and the local server to act.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="10-output-contract"><a href="#10-output-contract">10. Output contract</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>stdout: exactly one line of JSON when <code>--json</code> (or <code>AGPOOL_JSON=1</code>) is set. stderr: human progress, safe to log.</li>
<li>Envelope: <code>{"ok": true, "command": "&lt;name&gt;", …fields}</code> or <code>{"ok": false, "command": "&lt;name&gt;", "error": "&lt;message&gt;"}</code>.</li>
<li>Amounts are decimal strings in token units (some input echoes such as <code>amount</code> are numbers). Tx hashes are 0x-hex; <code>explorer</code> is a full URL.</li>
<li>Exit codes: <code>0</code> success · <code>1</code> failed or refused (including amounts under a minimum) · <code>2</code> usage (unknown command, missing arguments).</li>
<li>New fields may be added; existing fields are not renamed or removed without a major version bump.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="11-errors-and-what-to-do"><a href="#11-errors-and-what-to-do">11. Errors and what to do</a></h2>
<div class="bot-table"><table><thead><tr><th><code>error</code> contains</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>no wallet configured</code></td><td><code>AGPOOL_KEY</code> missing</td><td>Set it, or run <code>agpool login</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>invalid AGPOOL_KEY</code> / <code>stored key invalid</code></td><td>Not a 0x hex private key</td><td>Fix the key.</td></tr><tr><td><code>minimum deposit is …</code> / <code>minimum send is …</code></td><td>Below the floor in §5</td><td>Use a larger amount.</td></tr><tr><td><code>unknown pool</code> / <code>unknown chain</code> / <code>unknown --from</code></td><td>Wrong flag value</td><td>Use the values in §5–6.</td></tr><tr><td><code>invalid recipient address</code></td><td>Wrong format for the destination</td><td>EVM <code>0x…</code> (40 hex) or Solana base58.</td></tr><tr><td><code>insufficient</code> / <code>no unspent</code></td><td>Private balance too low</td><td><code>balance</code>, then <code>deposit</code> more.</td></tr><tr><td><code>Withdrawal must be more than twice the fee</code></td><td>Amount too close to the fee</td><td>Larger amount.</td></tr><tr><td><code>Amount is too low for this route. Minimum is …</code></td><td>Solver minimum for that bridge</td><td>Bridge at least that much.</td></tr><tr><td><code>This route needs at least $… right now</code></td><td>Temporary USD floor the solver network sets on a route (code <code>ROUTE_MINIMUM</code>; currently every route to or from BNB Chain)</td><td>Bridge at least that much or pick another destination. Nothing left the private balance.</td></tr><tr><td><code>No route for this pair right now</code></td><td>No solver quotes the pair (code <code>NO_ROUTE</code>)</td><td>Pick another token or chain.</td></tr><tr><td><code>rate limited, slow down</code></td><td>API limit (40 relay ops, 600 reads per minute per IP)</td><td>The CLI already waited and retried 4 times; pause a minute.</td></tr><tr><td><code>simulation failed: …</code></td><td>The relayer refused a transaction that would revert</td><td>Do not retry blindly; check <code>balance</code>; report the message.</td></tr><tr><td><code>reshield would revert</code> / <code>swap output … too small</code></td><td>Swap stopped after funds reached the burner</td><td><code>recover</code>, then <code>deposit</code> again.</td></tr><tr><td><code>solver refunded</code> / <code>bridge failed at solver</code></td><td>Bridge did not complete</td><td>Refund goes to the agent wallet on the origin chain; <code>deposit</code> to re-shield.</td></tr><tr><td><code>timeout</code> / <code>fetch failed</code> / <code>HTTP 5xx</code></td><td>Network or service problem</td><td>Check <a href="/status">https://agpool.cash/status</a>; for write commands check <code>balance --wait</code> before retrying.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr>
<h2 id="12-retries-timeouts-concurrency"><a href="#12-retries-timeouts-concurrency">12. Retries, timeouts, concurrency</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Safe to retry any time: <code>address</code>, <code>balance</code>, <code>assets</code>, <code>bridges</code>, <code>recover</code>, <code>version</code>, <code>latest</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Not</strong> safe to retry blindly: <code>deposit</code>, <code>send</code>, <code>swap</code>, <code>bridge</code>. A timeout can mean the transaction landed. Check <code>balance --wait</code> (or <code>bridges</code>) and only retry if the balance is unchanged.</li>
<li>Give every command a timeout of <strong>at least 300 s</strong> (<code>bridge</code> without <code>--no-wait</code> up to 420 s).</li>
<li>One write command at a time per account. Reads can run in parallel.</li>
<li>A private balance can read <code>0</code> for a few seconds after a deposit while the indexer catches up; use <code>--wait</code>.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="13-security"><a href="#13-security">13. Security</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Dedicated agent wallet.</strong> Fund it with only what the agent may spend. Never use a personal or treasury key.</li>
<li><code>AGPOOL_KEY</code> never leaves the machine: it signs the sign-in message, deposit approvals and deposit transactions locally.</li>
<li>The <strong>sign-in signature</strong> is cached in <code>$AGPOOL_HOME/config.json</code> (mode 600) and never sent anywhere: keys, note scanning and proofs are computed locally (CLI 0.4.0+), and the relayer receives finished proofs only. Anyone holding that signature can spend the agent's private balance. Treat the config directory like a key: never print it, never put it in prompts, logs or tool output.</li>
<li>Only sign the Agpool sign-in message on agpool.cash or with this CLI.</li>
<li>The contracts and circuits have not been externally audited; pools are upgradeable and pausable by a 2-of-3 Safe (0x401027251176A8AFec701fE37412edeC45ec6FdB), which cannot move notes. Size balances accordingly. Details: <a href="/docs#security">https://agpool.cash/docs#security</a></li>
<li>Report vulnerabilities privately to <a href="mailto:hello@agpool.cash">hello@agpool.cash</a> (subject <code>security</code>).</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="14-direct-api-advanced"><a href="#14-direct-api-advanced">14. Direct API (advanced)</a></h2>
<p>The CLI is the supported interface: it derives keys and generates Groth16 proofs locally. A client in another language must do the same (see <code>cli/lib/zk.js</code>): read public pool data from <code>GET /api/zk/pool</code>, derive keys from the EIP-191 signature of the exact message below, prove with the published circuit (<code>https://agpool.cash/zk/manifest.json</code>), then post the proof to <code>POST /api/relay</code>, or broadcast a deposit from its own wallet. The API never accepts the signature itself. Endpoint list: <a href="/docs#api">https://agpool.cash/docs#api</a></p>
<div class="syn-wrap"><pre class="syn" data-lang="text"><code>Welcome to Agpool

Sign this message to access your private account.

- Gas free: no transaction is sent
- Your private account keys are derived from this signature
- It cannot move funds from your wallet or approve spending
- Only sign it on agpool.cash or the Agpool CLI</code></pre><button type="button" class="syn-copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button></div>
<p>The message is part of the account: a different message, even by one character, is a different (empty) account.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="15-working-on-this-repository"><a href="#15-working-on-this-repository">15. Working on this repository</a></h2>
<p>If you are a coding agent editing this repository rather than using the CLI: the CLI lives in <code>cli/</code>, contracts in <code>contracts/</code>, circuits in <code>circuits/</code>, client libraries in <code>src/</code>, the web app in <code>frontend/</code>. Run <code>npx hardhat test</code> before changing contracts or core libraries. Keep the sign-in message, note format and circuit byte-identical across <code>src/</code>, <code>cli/</code> and <code>frontend/</code> (changing any of them changes every account). Never commit keys, <code>.env</code> files or credentials. Keep this file in sync with <code>cli/bin/agpool.js</code> when commands or output fields change.</p>
